# Fleshwrither (a 3/3 black Horror, mana value 4), cast with Black Lotus and a Mox Jet. Its transfigure {1}{B}{B} (CR 702.71a) is
# paid exactly with Blasted Landscape's {C} for the generic and two Mox Jets for the black pips, and the pool ends empty; with a
# Mox Ruby in place of the second Mox Jet the ability is not offered (a colored pip needs black). Paying sacrifices Fleshwrither,
# and it searches for a creature card with the same mana value as it had (4): of a noncreature card with mana value 4 (Wrath of
# God), creatures with mana values 3 and 5 and two creatures with mana value 4 (Hero of Bladehold, Axebane Ferox) only one
# of them may be found (a search for "a creature card"), and it is put onto the battlefield, untapped.

